closed.Description:
We have many stores reporting that expected inventory for Apparel items is not showing within the gStore app. Our own records show that these items have inventory at the associated stores, but within gStore it is showing 0 expected.

Examples from our system of Apparel items that have inventory in their stores and in their store systems, but not showing within gStore

Here is the API response from the Store Inventory Service, which returns 2 available. 
if this is the URL gStore is using for this scenario, then it should be receiving the correct qty.

Path: /inventory/availability-details?division=18&storeNumber=14122&skus=18-71-11209-8-00-950
Response
JSON
{
    "locationID": "1814122",
    "availabilities": [
        {
            "sku": "18-71-11209-8-00-950",
            "availableQty": 2,
            "reservedQty": 0
        }
    ]
}


Here is another response from our service, returning 5 qty.

Path: /inventory/availability-details?division=18&storeNumber=14122&skus=18-74-05916-3-00-930
Response
JSON
{
    "locationID": "1814122",
    "availabilities": [
        {
            "sku": "18-74-05916-3-00-930",
            "availableQty": 5,
            "reservedQty": 0
        }
    ]
}

